<title>USA: Bay Pond has 6.32 pct PacificAmerica stake.</title>
<headline>Bay Pond has 6.32 pct PacificAmerica stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bay Pond Partners LP said Friday it holds a 6.32 percent stake in PacificAmerica Money Center Inc or 114,200 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Bay Pond said its latest transactions include the purchase of 20,200 common shares on June 26 for $13.0787 per share.</p>
<p>Bay Pond bought the shares for investment purposes, the filing said.</p>
